Subject: [PATCH] hw/usb: emulate OMAP3 MUSB peripheral transfers

Model indexed endpoint registers, PIO FIFOs, interrupts, control status
phases, stalls, full/high speed reset and cable/VBUS changes. Connect
VBUS to the TPS65921 comparator and power interrupt. Expose the same
virtual USB host protocol and cable properties as the Diamond3 UDC.

